// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2980543208" "Crey industries is very large, very powerful, and very corrupt. I already attempted to invite the countess here using more diplomatic channels. Now it's time to show her what happens when she doesn't want to play nice. That's your job. She's visiting some of her holdings over in Nerva. I want you to break in and convince her to drop by the little party I'm having, or else I might send you again."
// AcceptString :
"P4105525757" "Deliver an invitation to Countess Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P3061251824" "I should warn you. The Countess has a habit of modifying herself with stolen genetic powers used in her hero-clone program. Usually mental abilities. The point is, this won't be easy."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4249093076" "'Invite' Countess Crey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P147571600" "Remember that you're not just going in there to beat up a defenseless business tycoon. Stay on your guard."

