// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 30 B_Boss :
"P4074500759" "Ah, {VillainName}. I've been waiting for you to arrive. <em>I know about the meeting, and I might consider attending. <em>However, I need something in exchange. <em>You've beaten Dreck, and the Countess Crey, and even Nemesis. <em>But I want to see what you can do against my villains. <em>If you can defeat the first one, that will be enough. <em>But there are 5 more who are waiting for a chance at you. <em>You don't have to fight them, but then you will know that you are a coward, and I will know that you lack the resolve to threaten my organization. <em>That's enough talking. <em>Let's see just how powerful you are."
// 4 B_Boss :
"P2794750560" "Let the battle begin!"

