"P2708804940" "You've passed the Center's Test. But how much more can you take?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2267309067" "{VillainName}? You're alive? Huh. Didn't expect that. Well, it's a good thing. I'm going to need to tap you for security at the conference. Rumor is that it might have been leaked to Longbow."
// RandomFameString :
"P89868548" "I heard that {VillainName} walked into a Council deathtrap! Now that's confidence."

