// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1887667559" "I could really use you at this conference. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have a bad feeling that something's going to go wrong, and I want some back-up there when it happens.</A> So far you've been able to handle everything I've thrown at you. I think you at least deserve to see the end of it."
// AcceptString :
"P3713640452" "Work confrence security"
// SendOffString :
"P2959597857" "If something happens, take care of it. The conference has to go on."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4096208150" "Secure the Conference"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1700360948" "Wait, what happened? Look, stop talking to me and handle it."

