// 6 N_7 :
"P3735555854" "While we wait for this to begin, I have one question I'd like to voice, which I'm sure is on everyone's mind."
// 4 B_2 :
"P3574155521" "Why have we been gathered here?"
// 4 B_3 :
"P3553256150" "What is Recluse's master plan?"
// 4 B_6 :
"P804018319" "Is this gonna be open bar?"
// 4 N_7 :
"P3439884876" "No. The question we should all be asking is:"
// 4 N_7 :
"P3896796237" "<f=B_1 em=point>What is Nemesis doing here?"
// 6 B_1 :
"P2485503679" "A good question, which will be answered just about... <em>Now."
// 0 B_17 :
"P254674508" "<Goto=E20>This is a Longbow action!"
// 6 EB_16 :
"P2593061449" "<Goto=E19 f=B_1 em=point>You are all under arrest!"
// 4 B_2 :
"P1636637619" "How did they find us?"
// 4 B_1 :
"P2867246426" "<em=Evillaugh>Elementary! I told them!"
// 0 B_2 :
"P3414813060" "<f=B_1 em=Angry>WHAT?"
// 0 EB_16 :
"P1367940147" "<f=B_1 em=what>WHAT?"
// 16 B_1 :
"P1397883711" "<em=SlashThroat>Those of you who are captured or defeated will be out of my way. <em=explain>And those that escape I might even invite them into my coming empire. <em=EvilLaugh>And As for me, well, this body is merely a robotic duplicate! <em>So, lay on, all of you!"
// 4 N_7 :
"P910265864" "<em=Hmm>And this is why I never invite Nemesis to anything."

